   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定含红色(0)、白色(1)、蓝色(2) 共 `n` 个元素的数组，**原地**对它们排序，使相同颜色相邻、按 0→1→2 顺序。不能调用排序库，进阶要求一遍扫描。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "nums = [2,0,2,1,1,0]",
      "output": "[0,0,1,1,2,2]"
     },
     {
      "input": "nums = [2,0,1]",
      "output": "[0,1,2]"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "n == nums.length",
     "1 <= n <= 300",
     "nums[i] 为 0、1 或 2"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "荷兰国旗三路分区：维护 `low`（0 区右界+1）、`mid`（当前考察）、`high`（2 区左界-1）。",
     "a[mid]==0 → 与 low 换（换来的是 1，mid++）；a[mid]==2 → 与 high 换（换来的未知，mid 不动）；a[mid]==1 → mid++。",
     "关键是「2 换回来的数没看过，mid 原地踏步；0 换回来的数必然是 1，可以放心 mid++」。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "low=0, mid=0, high=n-1",
     "a[mid]==0 → swap(mid, low)，low++/mid++",
     "a[mid]==2 → swap(mid, high)，high--",
     "a[mid]==1 → mid++；mid > high 结束"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n) 一遍",
     "space": "O(1)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def sortColors(self, nums: List[int]) -> None:\n        low, mid, high = 0, 0, len(nums) - 1\n        while mid <= high:\n            if nums[mid] == 0:\n                nums[low], nums[mid] = nums[mid], nums[low]\n                low += 1\n                mid += 1                 # 换来的是 1，可安全前进\n            elif nums[mid] == 2:\n                nums[mid], nums[high] = nums[high], nums[mid]\n                high -= 1                # 换来的未知，原地重查\n            else:\n                mid += 1"
   },
